## Deliberately not run

No live dev-autopilot execution was run against the real repo to observe
the fixed telemetry landing under a real VTID's OASIS event stream — doing
so would require actually triggering a Dev Autopilot execution (self-heal
or on-ramp), which this session has no standing approval to do outside the
already-shipped, default-OFF on-ramp. The fix is a source-level identifier
change verified by direct code reading + the regression tests above, not
by a live observation.
